WEBVTT

00:09:00.134 --> 00:09:03.729
You also need a great diversity
of chemical elements,

00:09:03.753 --> 00:09:06.761
and you need liquids, such as water.

00:09:06.785 --> 00:09:07.832
Why?

00:09:07.856 --> 00:09:11.728
Well, in gases, atoms move
past each other so fast

00:09:11.752 --> 00:09:13.205
that they can't hitch up.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:15.412
In solids,

00:09:15.436 --> 00:09:17.976
atoms are stuck together, they can't move.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:19.718
In liquids,

00:09:19.742 --> 00:09:22.780
they can cruise and cuddle

00:09:22.804 --> 00:09:25.106
and link up to form molecules.

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:28.135
Now, where do you find
such Goldilocks conditions?

00:09:28.674 --> 00:09:30.666
Well, planets are great,